Apply Nix's system-backend policy before reading the configuration.

An incomplete configuration can fail before readconf_defaults applies
HSYSBIN, leaving all compression backends in application-relative mode.
Nixpkgs sets HSYSBIN=2, so initialize the policy and disable its selector
unconditionally together with the other defaults.

--- a/dev/peach.pas
+++ b/dev/peach.pas
@@ -23443,7 +23443,10 @@
 forceconvert:=0;
 nativedrag:=1;
 autosync:=1;
-sys7zlin:=0;
+sys7zlin:=HSYSBIN;
+FormPeach.LabelSysBin.enabled:=false;
+FormPeach.ComboBoxSysbin.enabled:=false;
+FormPeach.ComboBoxSysbin.ItemIndex:=HSYSBIN;
 ignorepathdd:=0;
 level_brotli:=3;
 level_rar:=3;
